    <string name="wireless_title">Start via wireless debugging (no computer)</string>
    <string name="wireless_steps">1. Open Developer options and turn on Wireless debugging.\n2. Tap \"Pair device with pairing code\" — Android shows a 6-digit code and a pairing port. Enter both below and tap Pair (needed once).\n3. The wireless debugging screen also shows a connect port under \"IP address and port\" — enter it and tap Start. Azm Admin finds both ports automatically when it can, so they may already be filled in.</string>
